# 🎯 Smart Face Recognition Attendance Management System

 📌 Overview

A Django-based AI-powered attendance management system that uses Face Recognition and Machine Learning to automatically detect students and mark attendance in real time.

The system provides secure role-based access for Admin, Teachers, Students, and Parents with automated attendance tracking and academic management.

---

 🚀 Problem Solved

Traditional attendance systems are:

* Time-consuming
* Error-prone
* Easy to manipulate
* Difficult to manage at scale

This system solves these problems by automating attendance using real-time facial recognition.

---

 🧠 AI / ML Model Used

* Face Recognition Model
* OpenCV-based Image Processing
* Pickle Model Serialization
* NumPy Numerical Processing

The system detects and matches student faces against trained facial datasets for automatic attendance marking.

---

 🛠️ Tech Stack

 Backend

* Django

 Frontend

* HTML
* CSS
* Bootstrap

 Database

* SQLite

 AI / ML Libraries

* OpenCV
* NumPy
