---

 ✨ Features

 👨‍💼 Admin Module

* Manage departments
* Manage batches/courses
* Add/view/delete teachers
* View attendance reports
* Update attendance status

---

 👨‍🏫 Teacher Module

* Teacher login dashboard
* Add student records
* Capture student face dataset
* View students
* Mark attendance using face recognition
* Track attendance reports

---

 🎓 Student Module

* Student profile management
* View attendance history
* Update account details
* Track attendance records by date

---

 👨‍👩‍👧 Parent Module

* Parent login access
* Monitor student attendance performance

---

 🤖 Face Recognition Attendance

* Detect student face via camera
* Match with trained dataset
* Auto-mark attendance
* Prevent duplicate attendance entries
* Attendance confirmation system

---

 ⚙️ Workflow

1. Register student
2. Capture face dataset
3. Train recognition model
4. Detect face via webcam
5. Match with stored dataset
6. Mark attendance automatically
7. Store attendance records in database

---

 📊 Key Functional Highlights

* Real-time attendance automation
* Duplicate attendance prevention
* Role-based authentication
* Department & batch management
* Attendance filtering by course/date
* Student profile updates

---

 🔐 Security Features

* Django Authentication System
* Session-based login
* Password encryption
* Role-level access control

